{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorEmbeddingGL","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboActionKernel","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.WenzlMarkovTraceInstance"],"declarations":59,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.finrank_range_jimbo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.finrank_range_jimbo","kind":"theorem","line":675,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L675-L699","doc":"**Dimension of the image of the `gl_d` Jimbo action** = `∑_{ℓ(λ) ≤ d} (f^λ)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_rowCapProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_rowCapProd","kind":"theorem","line":662,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L662-L673","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.rowCapProd_surjective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.rowCapProd_surjective","kind":"theorem","line":650,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L650-L660","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.rowCapProd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.rowCapProd","kind":"def","line":642,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L642-L648","doc":"The projection onto the at-most-`d`-row seminormal blocks. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.RowCapIdx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.RowCapIdx","kind":"def","line":638,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L638-L640","doc":"Partitions of `m + 1` with at most `d` rows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_rowCap_blocks_vanish","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_rowCap_blocks_vanish","kind":"theorem","line":621,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L621-L628","doc":"**`gl_d` Schur–Weyl, kernel form.** The Jimbo action kills `x` exactly when every seminormal\nblock with at most `d` rows does: the kernel is the sum of the blocks with more than `d` rows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.rowCap_block_eq_zero_of_jimbo_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.rowCap_block_eq_zero_of_jimbo_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":585,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L585-L619","doc":"**Every block with at most `d` rows survives.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_of_rowCap_blocks_vanish","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_of_rowCap_blocks_vanish","kind":"theorem","line":571,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L571-L583","doc":"**Every block with more than `d` rows acts by zero.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.wenzlWeight_ne_zero_of_rows","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.wenzlWeight_ne_zero_of_rows","kind":"theorem","line":566,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L566-L569","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.wenzlWeight_eq_zero_of_rows","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.wenzlWeight_eq_zero_of_rows","kind":"theorem","line":561,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L561-L564","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.ker_jimbo_eq_traceRadicalIdeal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.ker_jimbo_eq_traceRadicalIdeal","kind":"theorem","line":543,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L543-L551","doc":"**The kernel of the `gl_d` Jimbo action is the trace-radical ideal of the level-`d` trace.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_wenzl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_wenzl","kind":"theorem","line":531,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L531-L541","doc":"**Kernel of the `gl_d` Jimbo action = radical of the level-`d` Wenzl trace form.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_qtr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_eq_zero_iff_qtr","kind":"theorem","line":520,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L520-L529","doc":"`x` acts by zero iff it is in the radical of the weighted trace form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.eq_zero_of_qtr_mul_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.eq_zero_of_qtr_mul_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":500,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L500-L518","doc":"**The weighted trace form is positive definite on `X ↦ X Xᵀ`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.dWeight_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.dWeight_pos","kind":"theorem","line":497,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L497-L498","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimboTrace_eq_wenzl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimboTrace_eq_wenzl","kind":"theorem","line":477,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L477-L484","doc":"**The `gl_d` Jimbo trace is the level-`d` Wenzl trace**, by uniqueness of the Markov trace at\n`z_d`.  Any field, `q` not a root of unity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimboMarkov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimboMarkov","kind":"def","line":458,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L458-L475","doc":"**The weighted trace of the `gl_d` Jimbo action is a Markov trace** with Wenzl's level-`d`\nparameter `z_d = (q²)^d / (q · [d]_{q²})`.  Any field; `[d]_{q²} ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimboTrace_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimboTrace_apply","kind":"theorem","line":455,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L455-L456","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimboTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimboTrace","kind":"def","line":450,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L450-L453","doc":"**The normalised weighted trace of the `gl_d` Jimbo action**\n`x ↦ Tr(K^{⊗(n+1)} ρ(x)) / [d]_{q²}^{n+1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.qtrLin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.qtrLin","kind":"def","line":444,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L444-L448","doc":"`qtr` as a linear functional. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_last","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_last","kind":"theorem","line":439,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L439-L442","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_heckeIncl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.jimbo_heckeIncl","kind":"theorem","line":428,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L428-L437","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.transpose_jimbo_mem_range","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.transpose_jimbo_mem_range","kind":"theorem","line":413,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L413-L421","doc":"**The image of the Jimbo action is closed under transpose.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.transposeSub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.transposeSub","kind":"def","line":400,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L400-L411","doc":"The matrices whose transpose lies in a given subalgebra form a subalgebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.embedPair_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.embedPair_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":392,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L392-L398","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.rCheckN_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.rCheckN_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":384,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L384-L390","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.qtr_jimbo_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.qtr_jimbo_comm","kind":"theorem","line":379,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L379-L382","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.qtr_eq_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.qtr_eq_trace","kind":"theorem","line":375,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/JimboGL.lean#L375-L377","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.dMat_commute_jimbo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.JimboGL.dMat_commute_jimbo","kind":"theorem","line":365,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Sc